<title>FINLAND: KAUPPAKAARI BUYS 1/3 OF SWEDISH IUSTUS.</title>
<headline>KAUPPAKAARI BUYS 1/3 OF SWEDISH IUSTUS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish publisher Kauppakaari Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it had acquired one third of Swedish publisher Iustus Forlag AB.</p>
<p>Kauppakaari said it also had an option to buy another third of shares Iustus.  </p>
<p>Annual turnover of Iustus Forlag, based in Uppsala, was five million crowns.</p>
<p>Kauppakaari did not give any financial details of the deal.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
